	/* On a wide screen the panel is tall and has the room: the photograph
	   leaves the name's side for the foot of the panel, under everything
	   said, its credit just above, within the panel's padding and centred.
	   The header's own box goes, so its picture can be placed apart from the
	   rest of it; the name keeps the room the header gave it. */
	@media (min-width: 1100px) {
		/* And the panel only the upper half of the picture's left, so the
		   picture below it stays in sight: a card of its own, set in from the
